{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 6, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "prod(n, 2, inf, 1 - 1/n^2)\n  converges: the factors are 1 + O(1/n^2) (sum |a_n - 1| converges)\n  = 1/2\n  method: the factors as (n - a_i)/(n - b_i): prod Gamma(2 - b_i)/Gamma(2 - a_i)\n  numeric: 0.500000000058105 (partial products to 4097, Richardson in 1/N twice; estimated error 6e-08)\n  check: agree (difference 5.8e-11)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 6, "ok": true, "cmd": "infinite_product", "ucas": "prod(n, 2, inf, 1 - 1/n^2)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "infinite_product", "converges": "the factors are 1 + O(1/n^2) (sum |a_n - 1| converges)", "value": "1/2", "method": "the factors as (n - a_i)/(n - b_i): prod Gamma(2 - b_i)/Gamma(2 - a_i)", "numeric": "0.500000000058105 (partial products to 4097, Richardson in 1/N twice; estimated error 6e-08)", "headline": "prod(n, 2, inf, 1 - 1/n^2)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "agree (difference 5.8e-11)"}], "files": [], "text": "prod(n, 2, inf, 1 - 1/n^2)\n  converges: the factors are 1 + O(1/n^2) (sum |a_n - 1| converges)\n  = 1/2\n  method: the factors as (n - a_i)/(n - b_i): prod Gamma(2 - b_i)/Gamma(2 - a_i)\n  numeric: 0.500000000058105 (partial products to 4097, Richardson in 1/N twice; estimated error 6e-08)\n  check: agree (difference 5.8e-11)\n"}, "isError": false}}
